<title>USA: NOTICE OF SALE - Carlsbad, Calif..</title>
<headline>NOTICE OF SALE - Carlsbad, Calif..</headline>
<text>
<p>NOTICE OF INTENTION TO SELL BONDS</p>
<p>				  NOT TO EXCEED</p>
<p>				  $10,379,732</p>
<p>			 (Government Code S53692)</p>
<p>   AGENCY:     CITY OF CARLSBAD, SAN DIEGO COUNTY, CALIFORNIA</p>
<p>   PROJECT:    ASSESSMENT DISTRICT NO. 95-1 (CARLSBAD RANCH)</p>
<p>   TYPE OF BONDS:     LIMITED  OBLIGATION   IMPROVEMENT  BOND</p>
<p>ISSUED</p>
<p>		  PURSUANT TO THE MUNICIPAL IMPROVEMENT ACT OF</p>
<p>		  1913 AND THE IMPROVEMENT BOND ACT OF 1915</p>
<p>   TERM:	 25 YEARS</p>
<p>   INTEREST RATE:     NOT TO EXCEED 12% PER ANNUM</p>
<p>   BOND DATE:  JULY  2,   1997,   OR  THE   31ST   DAY  AFTER</p>
<p>RECORDATION</p>
<p>		  OF THE ASSESSMENT ROLL AND DIAGRAM, WHICHEV-</p>
<p>		  ER IS EARLIER</p>
<p>   LEGAL OPINION:     BROWN, DIVEN &amp;  HENTSCHKE, ATTORNEYS AT</p>
<p>LAW</p>
<p>FINANCIAL</p>
<p>    CONSULTANTS:     KADIE-JENSEN, JOHNSON &amp; BODNAR MUNICIPAL</p>
<p>		  FINANCING CONSULTANTS</p>
<p>BIDS ARE TO BE RECEIVED ON OR BEFORE  THE 8TH DAY OF JULY, 1997, AT 10:00 A.M. in the office of:</p>
<p>		    KADIE-JENSEN, JOHNSON &amp; BODNAR</p>
<p>		 MUNICIPAL FINANCING CONSULTANTS, INC.</p>
<p>		 7801 MISSION CENTER COURT, 2ND FLOOR</p>
<p>			    SAN DIEGO, CA 92108</p>
<p>			 TELEPHONE: (619) 296-1450</p>
<p>			    FAX: (619) 293-3783</p>
<p>DATED: June 16, 1997</p>
<p>			  (From The Bond Buyer)</p>
</text>
